            "title": "histological-staining-area-quantification/histological-staining-area-quantification",
            "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
            "description": "This workflow performs colour deconvolution and automated thresholding to quantify stained area in brightfield histological images (MT, IHC). It accepts whole slides or pre-cropped ROIs.",
